---
// Minimalist Substack Subscription Box matching Nature's Hideaways Design System
---

<div class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto my-6 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#0F1720] border border-white/10 text-center">
  <p class="text-xs uppercase font-sans tracking-[0.2em] text-white/50 mb-2 font-medium">
    Substack Newsletter
  </p>
  <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-white font-normal mb-3">
    Letters from the Slow Road
  </h3>
  <p class="font-sans text-xs text-white/60 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
    Bi-weekly dispatches, transit breakdowns, and field notes sent directly to your inbox.
  </p>
  <a
    href="https://rekhoj.substack.com"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-white text-[#0A1118] font-sans text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-white/90 transition-all duration-200"
  >
    <span>Subscribe on Substack</span>
    <span class="ml-1 text-xs">↗</span>
  </a>
</div>
